[(RecordAccepted RecordIdentifier) (Proposed RecordIdentifier) (Clarified ClarificationReceipt) (Superseded SupersessionReceipt) (Retired RetirementReceipt) (ClarificationResolved ClarificationResolutionReceipt) (GuardianRejected GuardianRejection) (ReferentGuardianRejected ReferentGuardianRejection) (RecordsObserved ObservedRecords) (RecordsStashed StashedObservation) (RecordFound FoundRecord) (RecordsCounted CountedRecords) (CertaintyChanged CertaintyChangeReceipt) (ImportanceBumped ImportanceBumpReceipt) (RecordChanged RecordChangeReceipt) (ReferentRegistered ReferentRegistrationReceipt) (ObservationTapped ObserverSubscription) (ObservationUntapped ObserverRetraction) (SubscriptionStarted IntentSubscription) (VersionReported VersionReport) (MarkerReported DatabaseMarker) (RecordApplied RecordApplicationReceipt) (ApplyRefused ApplyRefusal) (Event IntentEvent) (Error ErrorReport) (Rejected SignalRejection)]
